// 8. reset opacity to $2\,\mathrm{prune\_opa}$ every 3000 steps; stop refining at 19k

// 1. each step accumulate AbsGS norms $g_i$; push current $g_i$ into a 100-step ring buffer
// 2. every refine_every after warmup:
// 3.   $\tau \leftarrow \mathrm{quantile}_{0.8}(\bigcup_t g^{(t)})$  // adaptive threshold
// 4.   high = $(\overline{g}_i > \tau)$, small = $\max(\exp(s_i)) \le 0.01\cdot \mathrm{scene}$
// 5.   blurry = mean radii $> 10\,\mathrm{px}$
// 6.   duplicate(high ∧ small);  split((high ∧ ¬small) ∨ (blurry ∧ ¬small))  // forced blur split
// 7.   prune $\sigma(o)<0.005$ or oversized
// 8. opacity reset every 3000 steps; refine_stop=15k (no noise injection used)

// 1. accumulate AbsGS gradient norms per Gaussian → grad2d, count
