// 4.   high $= \overline{g}_i > 6\!\times\!10^{-4}$
// 5.   duplicate(high ∧ small);  split(high ∧ ¬small, revised_opacity=True)
// 6.   prune $\sigma(o_i) < 0.003$, plus oversized after first reset
